    "description": "TikTok's Direct Post rules (developers.tiktok.com/doc/content-sharing-guidelines), in one place for the post's shape, the portal's form, the approve check and the adapter: the creator as `creator_info/query` answers it, the words TikTok requires, and why a post can't go yet"
   }
